{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21829","headline":"辛夷花 · 元稹","name":"辛夷花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问君辛夷花，君言已斑駮。\n不畏辛夷不烂开，顾我筋骸官束缚。\n缚遣推囚名御史，狼藉囚徒满田地。\n明日不推缘国忌，依前不得花前醉。\n韩员外家好辛夷，开时乞取三两枝。\n折枝爲赠君莫惜，纵君不折风亦吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}